- 30–60 days: Prepare a condensed fundraising/contingency plan keyed to the growth scenario (raise amount target for 12–18 months buffer, investor list, timeline).
- Board prep: One-page “key assumptions” sheet and a 3-slide deck: (1) current position & runway reconciliation, (2) 3-scenario cash model & asks, (3) key risks & mitigations.

Suggested KPIs / appendix items to include with the board pack
- Monthly revenue (LTM), ARR (if applicable), Gross margin, Gross profit dollars
- Customer concentration (% of revenue in top 5 customers)
- CAC, LTV, churn (if subscription), sales pipeline velocity
- Working capital (inventory days, receivable days, payable days)
- Committed capital expenditures and lease obligations
- Monthly net cash burn reconciliation (detail of major items)

