- Quarterly revenue and MRR (if applicable), revenue growth vs prior quarter.  
- Gross margin, contribution margin, and EBITDA (or adjusted EBITDA).  
- AR days and top 5 customers by % revenue.  
- Hiring and planned spend vs. actuals.  
- Top 3 risks and status of mitigations.

A short example board narrative (2–3 paragraphs you can drop into the memo)
