- Recommendation and next steps: Management will deliver a reconciled 12‑month cash forecast under three scenarios (base/slow/fast) and an AR aging/detail on top customers ahead of the board meeting. We request the board endorse a minimum runway policy and authorize the CFO to negotiate a short revolving facility as optionality.

