Board summary (one‑page draft)
- Executive summary: Metro Manufacturing ended the period with $2.1M cash. Last quarter revenue was $1.8M. At our reported net cash burn of $72K/month, we have ~29 months of runway; if runway is calculated conservatively to include planned commitments, that figure is currently stated as 20 months (please confirm). We remain revenue‑positive on a trailing‑quarter basis, but visibility depends on near‑term order book and receivables performance.
