- Risk: Economic downturn reduces orders and delays payments.
- Mitigations: (1) Stress-test cash flows under -20% and -40% revenue scenarios; (2) tighten collections; (3) preserve optionality for a bridge financing.
- Board asks: Approve scenario plan and a go/no-go trigger (e.g., runway <12 months or two consecutive down quarters).

