- Draft the “ask” email to the board chair summarizing the decision requested.

Questions for you to confirm before I finalize anything
1. Which runway figure is the company using (20 months) — is that including planned hires/capex or debt service? If so, please list expected one‑time/recurring items that increase burn.
2. Is the $1.8M last quarter revenue recurring (subscription/contracted) or lumpy/transactional?
3. What is your gross margin (or typical gross profit %) and DSO (days sales outstanding)?
4. Any planned hires or capital expenditures in the next 6–12 months we should include (and approximate monthly cost)?
5. Is the objective to obtain board approval for fundraising, for cost control measures, or for specific investments?

