4) Key risks (prioritized) with suggested mitigations
- Liquidity / Financing Risk (High impact)
  - Description: Runway sensitivity to higher-than-expected burn or revenue decline.
  - Mitigation: Finalize monthly cash forecast; set a board-approved trigger (e.g., 12 months) to begin fundraising; prepare investor-ready materials; postpone non-critical spend.
- Revenue Concentration (High)
  - Description: Large customers or a few accounts representing high % of revenue.
  - Mitigation: Report customer concentration metric; diversify pipeline; negotiate longer-term contracts and prepayments.
- Revenue Volatility / Collection Risk (Medium–High)
  - Description: Slower collections or quarter-to-quarter revenue swings compress cash flow.
  - Mitigation: Tighten AR terms, weekly collections dashboard, incentives for earlier payment, reserve for bad debt.
- Cost Overruns / Hiring (Medium)
  - Description: Uncontrolled hiring or recurring costs increase burn.
  - Mitigation: Immediate hiring freeze for non-essential roles; require Finance sign-off for hires and major contracts.
- Market / Demand Downturn (Medium)
  - Description: Macro slowdown causes lower order volume or pricing pressure.
  - Mitigation: Stress-test revenue scenarios; prioritize high-ROI sales initiatives and retention programs.
- Supply Chain / Delivery Risk (Medium)
  - Description: Disruptions increasing COGS or delaying revenue recognition.
  - Mitigation: Identify alternate suppliers, renegotiate terms, hold safety inventory for critical items.
- Execution / Product Risk (Medium)
  - Description: Product delays that impact renewals or renewals churn.
  - Mitigation: Prioritize roadmap items tied to customer retention; transparently communicate timelines to customers.
- Compliance / Legal (Low–Medium)
  - Description: Contract disputes or regulatory fines.
  - Mitigation: Legal review of large contracts, maintain reserve and insurance where appropriate.

5) KPIs and metrics to present monthly to the board
- Cash balance (actual) and 12-month cash forecast by scenario
