- KPIs: Cash balance, runway (with assumptions), monthly net burn, revenue run-rate, gross margin %, EBITDA, DSO (days sales outstanding), DPO, inventory days, customer concentration (top 5 %), backlog, capex commitments, headcount & monthly payroll run-rate.  
