- One-page dashboard: Cash, Runway (base / downside / upside), Revenue (QoQ), Gross margin, Net burn, AR days, Inventory turns, Major customer concentration.
- 3-scenario cash runway chart (Base / -20% / +25% revenue) — show month-by-month cash curve.
- Action & triggers table: pre-approved steps and when they are pulled.
- Ask slide: specific approvals requested (funding, hiring, programs).

